From b50d64a9bfb6dc675e52a7179ba4b99e4e7f49da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Schultze <alexschultze@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 08:18:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Support Runpod's OpenAI-compatible route (fixes 502 on
 /openai/v1)

Runpod's /openai/v1/... gateway sends {openai_route, openai_input} as the job
input. The handler only read 'messages'/'prompt', so it returned an error and
the gateway answered 502 Bad Gateway.

Forward /v1/chat/completions, /v1/completions, /v1/embeddings and /v1/models
to Ollama's native OpenAI-compatible API, with SSE streaming passthrough and
OpenAI-shaped errors. The configured HF_MODEL/OLLAMA_MODEL (or no model)
resolves to the default model. Adds unit tests, Hub test cases and docs.
